{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32392","headline":"清凉寺 · 温庭筠","name":"清凉寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄花红树谢芳蹊，宫殿参差黛巘西。\n诗合晓窗藏雪岭，画堂秋水接蓝溪。\n松飘晚吹摐金铎，竹荫寒苔上石梯。\n妙迹奇名竟何在，下方烟暝草萋萋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}